{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西班牙東北部加泰羅尼亞地區出現暴雨和洪災，至少兩人死亡，一人失蹤。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在皮內達德馬爾城區多處被泥水淹浸，有私家車和貨車被浸至拋錨，交通大受影響。多棵樹木倒塌，阻塞附近馬路，救援車到場協助清理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.FLOOD-2330_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rOMOA1VLwQ1791125883.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SPA.FLOOD-2330_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西班牙當局周日稱，加泰羅尼亞受暴雨和洪災影響。截至周日，當地接獲超過1,500宗洪水相關求助個案。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T15:38:23.955791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}